        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FPS234, Square 2-3/4 Inch Solid Brass Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-3/4 Inch Heavy Duty Square Flush Pull has a modern design that makes it great for contemporary spaces. This Square Pocket Door Pull is available in a wide selection of finishes. Flush pulls like this one are often used on pocket doors, but they can also be used on other sliding doors. The Modern 2-3/4 Square Flush Pull is mortised into the face of the door with a 7/16 inch depth.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FPS234-specifications.gif?v=1704354671\" width=\"435\" height=\"158\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FPS234 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FPS234 Heavy Duty Square Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Back Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Back Plate Height: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 1-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FPS234-specifications.pdf?v=1704262342\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FPS234 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2-3/4 Inch Heavy Duty Square Flush Pull",
                "description": "The 2-3/4 Inch Heavy Duty Square Flush Pull has a modern design that makes it great for contemporary spaces. This Square Pocket Door Pull is available in a wide selection of finishes. Flush pulls like this one are often used on pocket doors, but they can also be used on other sliding doors. The Modern 2-3/4 Square Flush Pull is mortised into the face of the door with a 7/16 inch projection.",
